This product includes the following bundled components:

1. keyword-intelligence
   Path: engine/keyword-intelligence/
   License: MIT (Copyright (c) 2026 Mario Montanari)
   Role: vendored offline analysis engine. The copy under engine/ is read-only
   and kept byte-identical to its source. Refresh it only with the sync script
   at engine/sync_engine.py.

2. plotly.js (partial "basic" bundle)
   Path: vendor/plotly/plotly-basic-3.6.0.min.js
   License: MIT (Copyright (c) 2012-2026 Plotly, Inc.)
   Source: https://cdn.plot.ly/plotly-basic-3.6.0.min.js
   Role: pinned, vendored charting library for the OPTIONAL interactive HTML
   dashboard (the --forge-interactive output of Output Forge). It is inlined into
   that one artifact, never fetched from a content delivery network at runtime,
   so the dashboard stays offline. The default HTML dashboard does not use it and
   stays script-free inline SVG. The bundle is kept byte-identical to the pinned
   download.

Optional third-party libraries are NOT bundled in this repository. The core
suite and the vendored engine run on the Python standard library alone. When a
module needs one of the libraries below, it imports it through a port that
degrades gracefully when the library is absent, so the suite still runs without
it. Each library keeps its own license; install it yourself if you want the
feature it powers.

3. python-pptx
   Used by: querymantic/ports/ooxml.py (Output Forge .pptx slide deck)
   License: MIT
   Source: https://pypi.org/project/python-pptx/

4. python-docx
   Used by: querymantic/ports/ooxml.py (Output Forge .docx audit document)
   License: MIT
   Source: https://pypi.org/project/python-docx/

5. openpyxl
   Used by: querymantic/ports/ooxml.py (Output Forge .xlsx workbook)
   License: MIT
   Source: https://pypi.org/project/openpyxl/

6. statsmodels
   Used by: querymantic/ports/stats.py (Demand Pulse optional STL seasonal path)
   License: BSD-3-Clause
   Source: https://pypi.org/project/statsmodels/
